        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const juce::ValueTree &amp;</type>
          <declname>baselineProfile</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Returns one profile table with one row for each zone of <computeroutput>samples</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Each zone is complete when the function creates it. It holds one <ref refid="class_statistics" kindref="compound">Statistics</ref> of the samples of the zone. Each row holds <computeroutput>value</computeroutput> (the median), <computeroutput>errorPercent</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>min</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>max</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>calls</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>unit</computeroutput>, and <computeroutput>samples</computeroutput>. A row whose zone the baseline profile also holds adds the comparison with the baseline zone of the same type: <computeroutput>baseline</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>change</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>probability</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>benchmarkType</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Type of the table. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>samples</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Samples of each zone. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>calls</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of calls of each zone. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>units</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Unit text of each zone. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>baselineProfile</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Table of an earlier report. It may be invalid. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The profile table. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
