    <briefdescription>
<para>Builds the profile trees and the report text of a scout run. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A profile is a table. Its rows are zones. The report writes each profile as a markdown table. The report starts with front matter. It adds one mermaid median chart for each unit, and one distribution chart for each zone that holds bins. The chart text comes from <computeroutput>jam::MermaidWriter</computeroutput> over <computeroutput>jam::MermaidDiagram::toDocument</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
